direction: down
prompt: 6-word prompt
agent: Coding agent
guess: Silent guesses
diff: Plausible diff
glance: Quick glance
regen: Regenerate
spec: Written spec
prompt -> agent: 6 open decisions
agent -> guess: fills the gaps
guess -> diff: runs, looks fine
diff -> glance: no red test
glance -> regen: wrong fix
regen -> agent: noisier context
glance -> spec: real fix
spec -> agent: 6 decisions written
